#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:4
msgid "v2.4.0"
msgstr "v2.4.0"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.4.0 is built on Qt Creator 4.0.2 and centers on the new V3 bootloader "
"(QSPI flash layout query during firmware loading and erase during a full "
"onboard-data-flash erase), live sensor and board reporting in the status "
"bar, and a new 32-bit USB debug protocol that matches the bundled firmware. "
"It also adds a first-run LED guide and a large set of new TensorFlow, "
"Modbus, and WiFi examples. Because the debug protocol changed, cameras must "
"run the new bundled firmware to connect."
msgstr ""
"A v2.4.0 é baseada no Qt Creator 4.0.2 e gira em torno do novo bootloader V3"
" (consulta do layout da flash QSPI durante o carregamento do firmware e "
"apagamento durante um apagamento completo da data flash interna), do "
"relatório ao vivo do sensor e da placa na barra de status, e de um novo "
"protocolo de depuração USB de 32 bits compatível com o firmware empacotado. "
"Ela também adiciona um guia de LED para a primeira execução e um grande "
"conjunto de novos exemplos de TensorFlow, Modbus e WiFi. Como o protocolo de"
" depuração mudou, as câmeras precisam executar o novo firmware empacotado "
"para se conectar."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Nesta página"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Destaques"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**V3 bootloader support** queries the layout of a board's external QSPI "
"flash during firmware loading and erases it during a full onboard-data-flash"
" erase (`d953df62f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d953df62f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Suporte ao bootloader V3** consulta o layout da flash QSPI externa de uma "
"placa durante o carregamento do firmware e a apaga durante um apagamento "
"completo da data flash interna (\\ `d953df62f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d953df62f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Sensor and board reporting** queries the connected camera's sensor module "
"on connect and shows it in the status bar (OV2640, OV5640, OV7690, OV7725, "
"OV9650, MT9V034, LEPTON) alongside a new board type label (`0ffa82958 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0ffa82958>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Relatório de sensor e placa** consulta o módulo de sensor da câmera "
"conectada na conexão e o exibe na barra de status (OV2640, OV5640, OV7690, "
"OV7725, OV9650, MT9V034, LEPTON) junto a um novo rótulo de tipo de placa (\\"
" `0ffa82958 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0ffa82958>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:30
msgid ""
"**TensorFlow model copy** lets you copy ``.tflite`` models to the cam, not "
"just ``.network`` neural-network files (`ad1aa98f0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ad1aa98f0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Cópia de modelos TensorFlow** permite copiar modelos ``.tflite`` para a "
"câmera, não apenas arquivos de rede neural ``.network`` (\\ `ad1aa98f0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ad1aa98f0>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Erase Onboard Data Flash** is a new ``Tools`` command that erases only the"
" cam's onboard filesystem flash, after a confirmation prompt, without "
"reflashing firmware (`d953df62f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d953df62f>`__, `98686ac46 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/98686ac46>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Erase Onboard Data Flash** é um novo comando de ``Tools`` que apaga apenas"
" a flash do sistema de arquivos interno da câmera, após um prompt de "
"confirmação, sem regravar o firmware (\\ `d953df62f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d953df62f>`__\\ , `98686ac46 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/98686ac46>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:38
msgid ""
"**First-run LED guide** is a new ``OpenMV Cam LED Colors`` dialog that "
"explains the onboard LED states and can be dismissed permanently (`c2d00422f"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c2d00422f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Guia de LED da primeira execução** é uma nova caixa de diálogo ``OpenMV "
"Cam LED Colors`` que explica os estados do LED interno e pode ser dispensada"
" permanentemente (\\ `c2d00422f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c2d00422f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:43
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Novos recursos"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"**V3 bootloader** queries the QSPI flash layout during firmware loading and "
"erases the external QSPI flash only during a full onboard-data-flash erase; "
"``connectClicked`` always drives ``bootloaderQSPIFLayout`` on V3 boards but "
"runs ``bootloaderQSPIFErase`` only when ``forceFlashFSErase`` is set (QSPI "
"write/memtest commands are implemented in the IO layer but are not exercised"
" by the loader) (`d953df62f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d953df62f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Bootloader V3** consulta o layout da flash QSPI durante o carregamento do "
"firmware e apaga a flash QSPI externa apenas durante um apagamento completo "
"da data flash interna; ``connectClicked`` sempre aciona "
"``bootloaderQSPIFLayout`` em placas V3, mas executa ``bootloaderQSPIFErase``"
" somente quando ``forceFlashFSErase`` está definido (os comandos de "
"escrita/memtest QSPI são implementados na camada de IO, mas não são "
"exercitados pelo loader) (\\ `d953df62f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d953df62f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Sensor and board status** queries the camera's sensor module on connect "
"and displays it (OV2640, OV5640, OV7690, OV7725, OV9650, MT9V034, LEPTON) in"
" the status bar, along with a new board type label, using a new "
"``sensors.txt`` id-to-name map (`0ffa82958 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/0ffa82958>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Status de sensor e placa** consulta o módulo de sensor da câmera na "
"conexão e o exibe (OV2640, OV5640, OV7690, OV7725, OV9650, MT9V034, LEPTON) "
"na barra de status, junto a um novo rótulo de tipo de placa, usando um novo "
"mapa de id-para-nome ``sensors.txt`` (\\ `0ffa82958 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0ffa82958>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"**First-run LED guide** adds a new ``OpenMV Cam LED Colors`` dialog that "
"pops up after a short delay when ``helloworld_1.py`` is the open document on"
" first run, explaining the onboard LED states (blinking green = bootloader "
"running, blue = running ``main.py``, white = hardware-failure panic); a "
"\"Don't show this message again.\" checkbox persists the dismissal via a "
"``DONT_SHOW_LED_STATES_AGAIN`` setting (`c2d00422f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c2d00422f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Guia de LED da primeira execução** adiciona uma nova caixa de diálogo "
"``OpenMV Cam LED Colors`` que aparece após um curto atraso quando "
"``helloworld_1.py`` é o documento aberto na primeira execução, explicando os"
" estados do LED interno (verde piscando = bootloader em execução, azul = "
"executando ``main.py``\\ , branco = pânico de falha de hardware); uma caixa "
"de seleção \"Don't show this message again.\" persiste a dispensa por meio "
"de uma configuração ``DONT_SHOW_LED_STATES_AGAIN`` (\\ `c2d00422f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c2d00422f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Open OpenMV Cam Drive folder** is a new ``Tools`` menu item that opens the"
" camera's mounted drive in the system file browser (`a49f54305 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a49f54305>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Open OpenMV Cam Drive folder** é um novo item do menu ``Tools`` que abre a"
" unidade montada da câmera no navegador de arquivos do sistema (\\ "
"`a49f54305 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a49f54305>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:67
msgid ""
"**Erase Onboard Data Flash** is a new ``Tools`` command that erases only the"
" onboard filesystem flash, after a confirmation prompt, without reflashing "
"firmware (`d953df62f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d953df62f>`__, `98686ac46 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/98686ac46>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Erase Onboard Data Flash** é um novo comando de ``Tools`` que apaga apenas"
" a flash do sistema de arquivos interno, após um prompt de confirmação, sem "
"regravar o firmware (\\ `d953df62f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d953df62f>`__\\ , `98686ac46 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/98686ac46>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:72
msgid ""
"**TensorFlow model copy** lets the model-copy dialog copy ``.tflite`` models"
" to the cam in addition to ``.network`` neural-network files; the dialog "
"filter also gained ``Label Files (*.txt)`` and ``All Files`` entries "
"(`ad1aa98f0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ad1aa98f0>`__, "
"`0ffa82958 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0ffa82958>`__, "
"`c0dbdd9e5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c0dbdd9e5>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Cópia de modelos TensorFlow** permite que a caixa de diálogo de cópia de "
"modelos copie modelos ``.tflite`` para a câmera, além de arquivos de rede "
"neural ``.network``\\ ; o filtro da caixa de diálogo também ganhou entradas "
"``Label Files (*.txt)`` e ``All Files`` (\\ `ad1aa98f0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ad1aa98f0>`__\\ , `0ffa82958 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0ffa82958>`__\\ , `c0dbdd9e5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c0dbdd9e5>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Debug-protocol version switch** breaks up ``GetAttribute``, "
"``SetAttribute``, ``FBEnable``, and ``JPEGEnable`` serial commands when "
"talking to firmware 3.5.3+ for reliability (`83b9ca18f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/83b9ca18f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Chave de versão do protocolo de depuração** divide os comandos seriais "
"``GetAttribute``\\ , ``SetAttribute``\\ , ``FBEnable`` e ``JPEGEnable`` ao "
"conversar com firmware 3.5.3+ para maior confiabilidade (\\ `83b9ca18f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/83b9ca18f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:82
msgid ""
"**New bundled examples** add TensorFlow Lite mobilenet and person-detection "
"sliding-window scripts plus an STM32Cube.AI (``nn_stm32cubeai.py``) MNIST "
"example, a new ``32-modbus`` folder (``modbus_rtu_slave.py``, "
"``modbus_apriltag.py``), WiFi shield additions (``http_client_ssl``, "
"``static_ip``, ``mqtt_pub``/``mqtt_sub``), Arduino UART/SPI-slave, and CAN "
"(`e26b90d79 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e26b90d79>`__, "
"`42ba8f5c4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/42ba8f5c4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Novos exemplos empacotados** adicionam scripts de janela deslizante para "
"mobilenet do TensorFlow Lite e detecção de pessoas, além de um exemplo MNIST"
" com STM32Cube.AI (\\ ``nn_stm32cubeai.py``\\ ), uma nova pasta "
"``32-modbus`` (\\ ``modbus_rtu_slave.py``\\ , ``modbus_apriltag.py``\\ ), "
"adições ao WiFi shield (\\ ``http_client_ssl``\\ , ``static_ip``\\ , "
"``mqtt_pub``\\ /\\ ``mqtt_sub``\\ ), Arduino UART/SPI-slave e CAN (\\ "
"`e26b90d79 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e26b90d79>`__\\ , "
"`42ba8f5c4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/42ba8f5c4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:91
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Outras mudanças e melhorias"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:93
msgid ""
"Updated the USB debug protocol to the new firmware: attribute reads use the "
"new 32-bit ``ATTR_READ_2`` (0xCA) command, and attribute, value, and "
"framebuffer-enable payloads are sent as 32-bit longs instead of 16-bit words"
" (`55d7cfe70 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/55d7cfe70>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Atualizou o protocolo de depuração USB para o novo firmware: as leituras de "
"atributos usam o novo comando de 32 bits ``ATTR_READ_2`` (0xCA), e os "
"payloads de atributo, valor e habilitação do framebuffer são enviados como "
"longs de 32 bits em vez de words de 16 bits (\\ `55d7cfe70 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/55d7cfe70>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:97
msgid ""
"Relabeled **Save open script to OpenMV Cam** to **Save open script to OpenMV"
" Cam (as main.py)** to clarify it writes ``main.py`` (`a49f54305 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a49f54305>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Renomeou **Save open script to OpenMV Cam** para **Save open script to "
"OpenMV Cam (as main.py)** para esclarecer que ele grava ``main.py`` (\\ "
"`a49f54305 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a49f54305>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:100
msgid ""
"Relabeled **Run Bootloader** to **Run Bootloader (Load Firmware)** to "
"clarify its purpose (`ad1aa98f0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ad1aa98f0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Renomeou **Run Bootloader** para **Run Bootloader (Load Firmware)** para "
"esclarecer seu propósito (\\ `ad1aa98f0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ad1aa98f0>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:103
msgid ""
"Example menus are now sorted by their numeric folder/file prefix, and the "
"leading ``NN-`` digits are stripped from the displayed names (`ad1aa98f0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ad1aa98f0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Os menus de exemplos agora são ordenados pelo prefixo numérico de "
"pasta/arquivo, e os dígitos iniciais ``NN-`` são removidos dos nomes "
"exibidos (\\ `ad1aa98f0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ad1aa98f0>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:106
msgid ""
"Output and serial terminals now render tabs as spaces using a configurable "
"serial-terminal tab width from the text-editor settings instead of a "
"hardcoded width of 8 (`98686ac46 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/98686ac46>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Os terminais de saída e serial agora renderizam tabulações como espaços "
"usando uma largura de tabulação de terminal serial configurável a partir das"
" configurações do editor de texto, em vez de uma largura fixa de 8 (\\ "
"`98686ac46 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/98686ac46>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:110
msgid ""
"Linux drive detection now also accepts ``fuseblk``-mounted filesystems (for "
"example exFAT/NTFS volumes) when associating the camera drive (`c0dbdd9e5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c0dbdd9e5>`__)."
msgstr ""
"A detecção de unidades no Linux agora também aceita sistemas de arquivos "
"montados como ``fuseblk`` (por exemplo, volumes exFAT/NTFS) ao associar a "
"unidade da câmera (\\ `c0dbdd9e5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c0dbdd9e5>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:113
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled MicroPython HTML documentation set (library reference, "
"esp8266/esp32 tutorials, generated pages and images) shown in the IDE help "
"(`e69d71f7c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e69d71f7c>`__, "
"`90b5c6eb5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/90b5c6eb5>`__, "
"`97b0f645a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/97b0f645a>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Atualizou o conjunto de documentação HTML do MicroPython empacotado "
"(referência da biblioteca, tutoriais esp8266/esp32, páginas e imagens "
"geradas) exibido na ajuda da IDE (\\ `e69d71f7c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e69d71f7c>`__\\ , `90b5c6eb5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/90b5c6eb5>`__\\ , `97b0f645a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/97b0f645a>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:120
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Correções de bugs"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:122
msgid ""
"Fixed a numeric overflow in the histogram statistics (mean, quartiles, "
"median, standard deviation) by widening the accumulators from ``int`` to "
"64-bit, preventing wrong stats on large images (`55d7cfe70 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/55d7cfe70>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Corrigiu um estouro numérico nas estatísticas do histograma (média, quartis,"
" mediana, desvio padrão) ampliando os acumuladores de ``int`` para 64 bits, "
"evitando estatísticas erradas em imagens grandes (\\ `55d7cfe70 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/55d7cfe70>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:126
msgid ""
"Reworked disconnect/eject on Linux: the unreliable ``syncfs``/``closedir`` "
"flush was removed and the drive is now unmounted with a plain ``umount`` "
"command, with no progress dialog (`b86d5c62c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b86d5c62c>`__, `c0dbdd9e5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c0dbdd9e5>`__, `30d4a7d2d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/30d4a7d2d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Refez a desconexão/ejeção no Linux: o pouco confiável flush ``syncfs``\\ /\\"
" ``closedir`` foi removido e a unidade agora é desmontada com um comando "
"``umount`` simples, sem caixa de diálogo de progresso (\\ `b86d5c62c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b86d5c62c>`__\\ , `c0dbdd9e5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c0dbdd9e5>`__\\ , `30d4a7d2d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/30d4a7d2d>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:132
msgid ""
"The board's USB drive is now only associated when the firmware is new enough"
" or a ``.openmv_disk`` marker file is present, preventing the IDE from "
"grabbing the wrong removable drive (`e464eaed4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e464eaed4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"A unidade USB da placa agora só é associada quando o firmware é novo o "
"suficiente ou quando um arquivo marcador ``.openmv_disk`` está presente, "
"evitando que a IDE pegue a unidade removível errada (\\ `e464eaed4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e464eaed4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:136
msgid ""
"Fixed reconnect logic so triggering a bootloader/erase operation while "
"connected now cleanly disconnects first and then retries, avoiding a stuck "
"working state (`d953df62f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d953df62f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Corrigiu a lógica de reconexão para que acionar uma operação de "
"bootloader/apagamento enquanto conectado agora desconecte de forma limpa "
"primeiro e depois tente novamente, evitando um estado de trabalho travado "
"(\\ `d953df62f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d953df62f>`__\\ "
")."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:140
msgid ""
"Rewrote the comment/whitespace stripper used when sending scripts to the cam"
" as a string-aware state machine, so ``#`` characters inside strings are no "
"longer mistaken for comments, and trailing whitespace and docstrings are "
"handled (`24dff1b2f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/24dff1b2f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Reescreveu o removedor de comentários/espaços em branco usado ao enviar "
"scripts para a câmera como uma máquina de estados ciente de strings, de modo"
" que caracteres ``#`` dentro de strings não sejam mais confundidos com "
"comentários, e espaços em branco no final e docstrings sejam tratados (\\ "
"`24dff1b2f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/24dff1b2f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:145
msgid ""
"Fixed translation-string handling for several connection/terminal dialog "
"messages so the embedded shell commands (``sudo adduser``, ``pydfu`` install"
" steps) are no longer part of the translatable text and render correctly "
"(`b5705a57e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b5705a57e>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Corrigiu o tratamento de strings de tradução para várias mensagens de caixa "
"de diálogo de conexão/terminal, de modo que os comandos de shell embutidos "
"(\\ ``sudo adduser``\\ , etapas de instalação do ``pydfu``\\ ) não façam "
"mais parte do texto traduzível e sejam renderizados corretamente (\\ "
"`b5705a57e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b5705a57e>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:151
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Suporte de plataforma e ferramentas"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:153
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Base do Qt Creator:** 4.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:154
msgid ""
"Renamed the OpenMV Cam H7 Plus board/firmware from ``OPENMV4R`` to "
